{"series":{"id":"chronicles-ancient-grudges","slug":"chronicles-ancient-grudges","title":"Chronicles of Ancient Grudges","image":"https://donghualife.com/images/webp/chronicles-ancient-grudges-1__coverImage.webp","synopsis":"En el pasado, Qin Feng, un joven genio del Reino Wuji, brillaba con una luz deslumbrante. Sin embargo, su familia fue falsamente incriminada y exterminada, llevándolo a caer al abismo en un solo día. Con su vena marcial destruida y relegado a una secta marginal, sufrió todo tipo de humillaciones, pero nunca se rindió. En la oscuridad, inició en solitario un arduo camino de cultivo físico, con un solo propósito: algún día, tomar la espada con sus propias manos, vengar a su familia y lavar la vergüenza con sangre.","genres":["Cultivo","Venganza","Acción","Aventura"],"sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/series/chronicles-ancient-grudges","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:34:28.102Z"},"seasons":[{"id":"chronicles-ancient-grudges-1","slug":"chronicles-ancient-grudges-1","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/chronicles-ancient-grudges-1-1","image":null,"number":1,"seriesId":"chronicles-ancient-grudges","firstEpisodeUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/chronicles-ancient-grudges-1-1","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:34:48.934Z","episodeCount":40,"minEpisodeFound":1,"maxEpisodeFound":40,"missingEpisodes":[],"paginationComplete":true,"initialSyncComplete":true}],"episodes":[{"id":"chronicles-ancient-grudges-1-1","slug":"chronicles-ancient-grudges-1-1","title":"Chronicles of Ancient Grudges — Cap. 1","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/chronicles-ancient-grudges-1-1","servers":[],"previousUrl":null,"nextUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/chronicles-ancient-grudges-1-2","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:34:28.757Z","seriesId":"chronicles-ancient-grudges","seasonId":"chronicles-ancient-grudges-1","number":1,"releaseDate":null},{"id":"chronicles-ancient-grudges-1-2","slug":"chronicles-ancient-grudges-1-2","title":"Chronicles of Ancient Grudges — Cap. 2","sourceUrl":